{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7b9222a3a40b5472","name":"Pulse Rifle","source":{"id":"source:reference-7b9222a3a40b5472","title":"Pulse Rifle","revision":19738,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:31:22Z","sha256":"d51fed0ac93273f43437c9899976a9c78e1a7f4a0831b23b5507e8df2ec59822","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19738","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Pulse%20Rifle&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7b9222a3a40b5472","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Corondexx VES-700 Pulse Rifle is favored by smugglers, bounty hunters, and other outlaws for use on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"}," and in urban environments where they are likely to be cornered. Unlike normal blaster weapons, a Pulse Rifle targets all targets within a 6-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cone"}," as an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"},". \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," with a Pulse Rifle, you make a single attack roll and compare the result to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of every target in the 6-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cone"},". Creatures you hit take full damage, and creatures you miss take half damage. A target with the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Evasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Evasion"}]}," Talent takes half damage from a successful attack, and no damage if the attack misses.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Pulse Rifle requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," to operate. After 5 shots, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," must be replaced.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons (Ranged)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Ranged)","referenceId":"reference:c954289d43de9110"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 5,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 2.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Illegal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illegal"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," This is an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," weapon.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
